      "content": "<div class=\"abbs-post-photo-wrap\">\n  <img src=\"images/Evernote__1_.jpg\" class=\"abbs-post-photo\" alt=\"大马士革门前的商贸驼队 (Damascus Gate, Jerusalem)\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-weight:600; margin-top:12px; color:var(--text-primary);\">大马士革门前的商贸驼队 (Damascus Gate, Jerusalem)</p>\n<p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7;\">耶路撒冷老城北面最壮观的城门大马士革门，城门前聚集着阿拉伯商队与骆驼。</p>"
    },
