      "content": "<div class=\"abbs-post-photo-wrap\">\n  <img src=\"images/Evernote__11_.jpg\" class=\"abbs-post-photo\" alt=\"橄榄山远眺圣殿山 (Mount of Olives & Temple Mount)\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-weight:600; margin-top:12px; color:var(--text-primary);\">橄榄山远眺圣殿山 (Mount of Olives & Temple Mount)</p>\n<p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7;\">从橄榄山向西俯瞰阿克萨与圆顶清真寺，百年前的耶路撒冷天际线纯净肃穆。</p>"
